  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=24>- Dragon Spin is triggered randomly when there is no 3rd Scatter
      on reel 3 \n   following reels 1 and 2.\n- When triggered, Dragon awards Scatter
      on reel 3 and re-spins reels 4 and 5.\n- Award Scatter pay after re-spin, then
      begin Free Games.\n- Dragon Spin is not triggered during Free Games."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: "<size=24>- 3 or more Scatters beginning from reel 1 triggers Free Games.\n
      \       - 3 Scatters = 15 Free Games\n        - 4 Scatters = 20 Free Games\n
      \       - 5 Scatters = 25 Free Games\n\n- If wins include the Wild symbol, pay
      is multiplied by 3."
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>243 WAYS</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Base Bet: 25</color></size>'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Dragon Empire
